<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Kids: Snakes" id="001038a2" height="411" width="574" hasaudio="0" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="kidsWhite" skinlib="kids1"><slides><slide type="standard" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las serpientes tienen cuerpos largos y delgados cubiertos de escamas. No tienen brazos ni piernas. La mayoría de las serpientes viven en el suelo o en los árboles. Algunas viven en el agua.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Serpientes&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>001038a2_1.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="153" y="8"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Serpiente piloto&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>1</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>378</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>377</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Serpiente piloto&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="149" y="9" w="118" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B82E223</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Serpientes&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="2" slideid="2"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las serpientes tienen lenguas bífidas que pueden usar para oler. Sacan y meten la lengua de la boca para captar los olores que hay en el aire. Esos olores les permiten saber si hay otros animales cerca.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Lenguas bífidas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>001038a2_2.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="158" y="10"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Culebra de collar&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Culebra de collar&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="154" y="11" w="125" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Lenguas bífidas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="3" slideid="3"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La mayoría de las serpientes comen animales pequeños como ranas, ratones y aves. Las serpientes no pueden masticar, así que abren mucho las mandíbulas y tragan a sus presas enteras. En realidad, las serpientes de gran tamaño pueden tragar incluso cerdos pequeños o cabras.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Depredadores sorprendentes&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>001038a2_3.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="162" y="6"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Boa constrictor&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Boa constrictor&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="158" y="7" w="112" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>29D26540</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Depredadores sorprendentes&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="4" slideid="4"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Por lo general, las serpientes se despojan de la piel cuando esta se vuelve vieja y se desgasta. La serpiente frota su cabeza contra algún objeto áspero para perder la piel alrededor de la boca. Entonces se desprende de la piel vieja, bajo la que aparece otra nueva.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Piel de las serpientes&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>001038a2_4.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="97" y="5"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;New Caption&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>1</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>1</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Serpiente despojándose de su piel&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="93" y="6" w="241" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B829986</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Piel de las serpientes&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="5" slideid="5"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las serpientes venenosas tienen dos grandes dientes llamados colmillos. Cuando la serpiente muerde a un animal, los colmillos inyectan el veneno. El veneno inmoviliza al animal o lo mata.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Serpientes venenosas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>001038a2_5.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="128" y="5"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Serpiente de cascabel&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>378</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Serpiente de cascabel&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="124" y="6" w="158" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>29D26541</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Serpientes venenosas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide></slides><slideshowcontrol bottombarbgcolorid="3" textdividerbarcolorid="3" creditsbuttonstyleid="2" resetbuttonstyleid="3" navbuttonstyleid="1" numbermenuitems="0" showpop="1" autoadvance="0" shownavarrows="1" bottombarheight="31"><audiocontrollerstyle bgcolorid="3" progresscolorid="4" guttercolorid="5" graphiccolorid="2" outlinecolorid="3" buttonstyleid="1"/><popmenustyle listtextstyleid="5" displaytextstyleid="5" selectedlisttextstyleid="5" rolllisttextstyleid="5" downlisttextstyleid="5" rolloutlinecolorid="6" displaybgcolorid="2" listbgcolorid="2" listoutlinecolorid="6" displayoutlinecolorid="6" popbuttonstyleid="1"><scrollbarstyle guttercolorid="6" thumbbasecolorid="7" thumbrollcolorid="8" thumbdowncolorid="8" buttonstyleid="1"/></popmenustyle><captionscrollbarstyle guttercolorid="6" thumbbasecolorid="7" thumbrollcolorid="8" thumbdowncolorid="8" buttonstyleid="1"/><creditsbuttontext>&lt;html&gt;Credits&lt;/html&gt;</creditsbuttontext><resetbuttontext>&lt;html&gt;Reset&lt;/html&gt;</resetbuttontext><currentslidetext textstyleid="6"><text>&lt;html&gt;% de #&lt;/html&gt;</text></currentslidetext></slideshowcontrol><textstyles><textstyle size="15" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="9" align="left" id="1"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" ita